{"id":"A1-L109","title":"Want and need + to: production and review","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U07","focus":"Want / need + to — produção e revisão","targets":{"grammar":"Want / need + to — produção e revisão","pron":"ship/sheep","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["hostel","flashlight","path","staff","winter","perfect","bring","show"],"field":"Lugares","genre":"Resenha / review","skill":"Leitura","words_min":8},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 109 · Want and need + to: production and review","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Want / need + to — produção e revisão.","**Pronúncia:** ship/sheep.","**8 palavras novas** (lugares).","**Texto do dia:** resenha / review."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo escrever uma resenha com want/need to."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **ler textos curtos e achar informação (IELTS Reading, TOEFL Reading)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["hostel","albergue"],["flashlight","lanterna"],["path","trilha"],["staff","equipe"],["winter","inverno"],["perfect","perfeito"],["bring","trazer"],["show","mostrar"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A review","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Review: Mountain Hostel ★★★★☆","paras":["If you **want to** relax, this hostel is perfect. You **need to** bring a flashlight—there are no lights on the path. You **don’t need to** book early in winter.","The staff **wants to** help you: they will **pick up** your bag and **show** you around."],"kicker":"HOSTEL REVIEW","by":"Tom, 4 stars","gloss":[["hostel","albergue"],["flashlight","lanterna"],["path","trilha"],["staff","equipe"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"You need to bring a flashlight.","ans":"T","why":"bring a flashlight."},{"q":"You need to book early in winter.","ans":"F","why":"don’t need to."},{"q":"The staff wants to help.","ans":"T","why":"wants to help."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“hostel” means…","opts":["albergue","hotel de luxo","acampamento"],"ans":0,"why":"hostel."},{"q":"“path” means…","opts":["trilha","rua","ponte"],"ans":0,"why":"path."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Want / need to: production","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Para…","Exemplo"],"rows":[["recomendar","**You need to bring a flashlight.**"],["dizer que não precisa","**You don’t need to book.**"],["dizer o que o staff quer","**The staff wants to help.**"]],"cap":"Want / need to: production"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Para recomendar, **should** também funciona: *You should bring a flashlight.*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"You ___ to bring a flashlight. (need)","a":"need","why":"need to."},{"s":"You ___ need to book. (don’t)","a":"don’t","why":"não é preciso."},{"s":"The staff ___ to help. (wants)","a":"wants","why":"want to."},{"s":"They ___ up your bag. (pick)","a":"pick","why":"pick up."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["hostel","albergue"],["flashlight","lanterna"],["path","trilha"],["staff","equipe"],["winter","inverno"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["you","do","Yes"],"ans":"Yes you do","pt":"Sim."},{"words":["book","Do","I","need","to"],"ans":"Do I need to book","pt":"Preciso reservar?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"hostel","pos":"word","pt":"albergue","ex":"A mountain hostel.","expt":"Um albergue da montanha."},{"w":"flashlight","pos":"word","pt":"lanterna","ex":"Bring a flashlight.","expt":"Leve uma lanterna."},{"w":"path","pos":"word","pt":"trilha","ex":"A dark path.","expt":"Uma trilha escura."},{"w":"staff","pos":"word","pt":"equipe","ex":"The staff.","expt":"A equipe."},{"w":"winter","pos":"word","pt":"inverno","ex":"In winter.","expt":"No inverno."},{"w":"perfect","pos":"word","pt":"perfeito","ex":"A perfect place.","expt":"Um lugar perfeito."},{"w":"bring","pos":"word","pt":"trazer","ex":"Bring a coat.","expt":"Traga um casaco."},{"w":"show","pos":"word","pt":"mostrar","ex":"Show me around.","expt":"Mostre-me o lugar."}]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"tip","t":"Verbos desta aula","body":"Esta aula revisa verbos já vistos dentro das frases do diálogo e dos exercícios. Observe: **be, have, do**."}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"At the hostel","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"At the hostel","lines":[["Tom","Do I need to book?","Preciso reservar?"],["Staff","No, you don’t need to.","Não precisa."],["Tom","Do I need to bring a flashlight?","Preciso trazer lanterna?"],["Staff","Yes, you do.","Sim."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: ship/sheep","items":[{"label":"ship/sheep","note":"/ɪ/ curto (ship) × /i/ longo (sheep).","words":["ship","sheep","sit","seat","live","leave"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Recommend a place.","pt":"Recomende.","model":"You need to bring a flashlight."},{"q":"Say what you don’t need to do.","pt":"Diga.","model":"You don’t need to book."},{"q":"Say what the staff wants.","pt":"Diga.","model":"The staff wants to help."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 5-line review with want/need to.","model":"If you want to relax, go there. You need to bring a flashlight. You don’t need to book early. The staff wants to help. I love it.","checklist":["Usei **want to**","Usei **need to**","Dei **recomendação**"],"words":"5 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “hostel” mean?","opts":["albergue","lanterna","equipe"],"ans":0,"why":"**hostel** = albergue."},{"q":"What does “flashlight” mean?","opts":["trilha","lanterna","inverno"],"ans":1,"why":"**flashlight** = lanterna."},{"q":"What does “path” mean?","opts":["equipe","perfeito","trilha"],"ans":2,"why":"**path** = trilha."},{"q":"What does “staff” mean?","opts":["equipe","inverno","trazer"],"ans":0,"why":"**staff** = equipe."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}